WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
Hi, I'm Dave and I run my own construction
company.

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.600
The main part I dislike about running my
own company

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
is I'm out on the tools all day, I'm out
on the site all day

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.300
and then I come home and then I've got to
invoice

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.200
and chase up work and do my bookings.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.200
So my day turns into a 15 to 16 hour day

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.500
because I'm doing most of my admin work by
myself.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.500
I did pay this company to streamline the
process

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.100
and do my bookings and my invoices

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.700
and chase up clients for me.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.800
What they did has made it more messy for
myself. It was clunky.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.200
I was struggling to figure out what they
did.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.800
It sent me back to where I started from
again.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.800
That platform was a mess.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.000
And what I mean by mess is it wasn't
helping me.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.800
It made my job even longer and it tired me
out and drained me.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.400
And then I found Andy and the team and
straight from the beginning,

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.600
I realized this is the team that I need.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.500
The conversations were straight.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.000
There was no salesy pitch.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.400
There was no pushing me towards something

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.400
I didn't wanna do.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:53.600
I really dug into it.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.500
This is the company I wanted to go for

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.000
cause I knew what they were talking about.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.800
I knew exactly that they could fix my
invoicing problem

00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.200
and chasing leads.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.500
They straight away knew exactly what I was
talking about

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:04.400
and they fixed it.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.200
Straight away, I knew Andy and the team
were perfect. They came in straight away.

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:12.322
There was a no blame. They got in, dug
into it straight away and started making

00:01:12.322 --> 00:01:13.000
the processes

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.105
smoother. They told me straight how it was
and how we could fix it. Now finally, my

00:01:17.105 --> 00:01:17.600
platform's

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:22.062
working. I can actually book my clients. I
feel like the weight has been lifted and

00:01:22.062 --> 00:01:22.600
now I have

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.168
the confidence that my clients aren't
going missing and I'm gonna get paid on

00:01:26.168 --> 00:01:26.400
time.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.200
I finally trust my own platform now.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.600
Instead of bracing for it to fail again

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.200
and then having to pick up all the pieces
and be hours away,

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.800
just pulling my hair out, thinking,

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.000
what am I gonna do next?

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.400
How can I make this better?

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.400
Was it worth it?

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.400
No questions.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.200
I'd written the whole thing off in my head

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.600
and Andy and the team brought it back to
life for me.

00:01:43.600 --> 00:01:47.151
If you ever left with a mess and you think
like you had to start over again, talk to

00:01:47.151 --> 00:01:48.800
Andy and the team first. There might be

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.500
a lot more worth saving than what you
think.
